{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41200","headline":"赠罗隐 · 罗衮","name":"赠罗隐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平日时风好涕流，谗书虽盛一名休。\n寰区叹屈瞻天问，夷貊闻诗过海求。\n向夕便思青琐拜，近年寻伴赤松游。\n何当世祖从人望，早以公台命卓侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗衮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41200.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41200","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}